-- The Bogden Road Country Inn's common room (the inn sheet's first floor plan), redrawn in our pieces. North
-- is up, as the sheet has it: the kitchen and the back bar along the west wall, the square bar in the
-- north, long tables to the east, the hearth in the middle, round tables round it, and the door to the road
-- in the south-east. The south wall is left off: the DM's side. The cellar trapdoor and the loading yard
-- aren't on this board.

